// Analytics rule (tuned): T1053.005 Scheduled task created
// Drops only the proven-noisy pattern: machine account AND Microsoft's own task folder.
// Schedule: every 5 min, lookback 10 min; alert grouping on (all entities, 1 h) to stop duplicates.
// Entities: Host=Computer, Account Name=SubjectUserName, Account Sid=SubjectUserSid
// Blind spot: SYSTEM-level task masquerading under \Microsoft\Windows\ (T1036) is still filtered.
SecurityEventParsed
| where EventID == 4698
| where not(SubjectUserName endswith "$" and TaskName startswith @"\Microsoft\Windows\")
| project TimeGenerated, Computer, SubjectUserName, SubjectUserSid, TaskName
